raph\" >MONSTER AI </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140540/extras/c355fe2fa01e033c07fc1da6d4e095a7.poster.avif?t=1727014431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140540/extras/c355fe2fa01e033c07fc1da6d4e095a7.webm?t=1727014431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140540/extras/c355fe2fa01e033c07fc1da6d4e095a7.mp4?t=1727014431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
